41720515922969","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/d985bb83b845a29d703961e63470e5b8~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799164603&x-signature=7y6QH2OKh%2Bx6bQ6iFy59lQFjtX8%3D","duration":9969,"title":"从蛇腹归来我在雨林挣万贯家财","video_desc":"陆川重生回到妻女被逼入蛇洞那一天，蟒腹中吞下龙珠获得神力，救下家人。他痛改前非，靠一双慧眼在雨林绝壁采得绝品药材，五天内还清旧债，护妻暖女。哥嫂借机侵占祖产，被他当众算清并买断；他全款提回越野摩托，登门向岳父认错，又借云豹引路采得山参、石斛、灵芝，识破药贩掺假。他盖起全公社头一座两层洋楼，再入深谷寻得血珀，助沈老板拿下二十年外贸总包，一家五口从此踏实圆满。","series_id":"7702439989518273598","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623564123ABEAAA5411B2ACEB61\",\"rank\":\"3\",\"queue_names\":\"aigc,shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"aigc\",\"gid\":\"7702439989518273598\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.07477004826068878,\\\"finish\\\":0.07159119844436646,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.2890509366989136,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.8309459686279297,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.4040365517139435,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.025535279884934425,\\\"like\\\":0.10669058561325073}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7702439989518273598","play_cnt":870199,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"河南硕文科技有限公司","sub_title":"年代·全146集","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":146,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5464,\"name\":\"年代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5464&categoryName=年代&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5502,\"name\":\"重生逆袭\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5502&categoryName=重生逆袭&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5508,\"name\":\"经营奋斗\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5508&categoryName=经营奋斗&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5695,\"name\":\"异能\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5695&categoryName=异能&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5647,\"na